message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite it as below, and also cite the
  original studies whose data you use (each study's citation and DOI are
  provided in the database). A paper describing the database is in
  preparation; this file will be updated with its DOI on publication.
title: "The Liking Initiative: a database of subjective evaluation ratings for decision-making research"
type: dataset
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22216442
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/liking-initiative/liking-rating-database"
